# Vietnamese bound-phrase emphasis

Vietnamese compound words are often two syllables (`im lặng`, `hình ảnh`). They are listed in `VIETNAMESE_BOUND_PHRASES` in `text-language.ts`.

**Never emphasize only part of a bound phrase.** If scoring picks one syllable, call `expandEmphasisToBoundPhrases` so every syllable in that phrase is emphasized together.

When adding new two-syllable Vietnamese words, add both accented and unaccented forms to `VIETNAMESE_BOUND_PHRASES`.

Bad: only `lặng` glows in `… im lặng.`

Good: both `im` and `lặng` glow together.
